4️⃣ Chaining Async Operations

Real systems often need multi-step async processing.

thenApply()

Transforms result.

CompletableFuture<Integer> future =
        CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> 10)
                .thenApply(x -> x * 2);

System.out.println(future.get());

Output:

20
thenAccept()

Consumes result but returns nothing.

CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> "Transfer Completed")
        .thenAccept(System.out::println);
thenRun()

Runs after completion but no input/output.

