Async code must handle failures properly.

exceptionally()
CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -> {
    throw new RuntimeException("Error");
})
.exceptionally(ex -> {
    System.out.println("Handled: " + ex.getMessage());
    return "Fallback";
